		{"id":"tools","type":"text","text":"🔧 **TOOLS (基础设施)**\n**算力与工具链**\n\n**内容：**\n- 🖥️ **Local RTX 3090**\n- 🐳 Docker (Dify/n8n)\n- 🔌 OneAPI Gateway\n- 🐍 Automation Scripts\n\n**特点：**\n- 物理运行环境\n- 算力主权支撑","x":560,"y":-610,"width":320,"height":350,"color":"3"},
